{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">hey. want to start a cult? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>slides you this old, kinda glowing phone</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">this phone? it's your new bff (if cult leader is your dream job). it's a <strong>cozy incremental game</strong>. you tap, numbers go up, and you build a surprisingly deep cult-y media empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">the phone's the key. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>it gets passed down, leader to leader. now it's your turn.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">grab apps like <strong>faithbook, instagrim, &amp; hypnoscroll</strong>. you'll be optimizing faithbait titles, analyzing cult trends, responding to followers and, y'know, normal cult stuff.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>gather your flock:</strong> collect faith, cash, and followers. leader stats grow (mostly) with age and really help out. but they get kinda tired. and old.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>new beginnings:</strong> leaders eventually ascend. they leave behind 'devotion dust' (currency) for new apps and sweet permanent upgrades. then, the phone finds a new leader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>let it flow:</strong> you'll tap a bit at first. later? automate resource gathering, even influencer minigames. just chill and watch your cozy cult expand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>new cult, who dis?:</strong> who even gave you this phone? might be fun to find out.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">so yeah. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">download apps. play quirky influencer minigames. automate all the things. ascend for power. unravel a weird mystery. all from this one special phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>it's pretty chill.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(until it isn't. jk. <strong>probably</strong>.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725620?t=1752631164","background_raw":"https://